                                        <TextBlock Text="The lightweight English model and engines are included with Wyspa. Transcription works offline. Speed depends on your PC and model; start with Zipformer for live dictation. Local mode skips Groq Tone Re-write, AI actions and Stream Fix, and cannot generate summaries. Basic cleanup and recognised keyboard commands remain available. YouTube imports still require internet." Style="{StaticResource BodyText}" Margin="16,0,16,16" />
